{"5092870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fidget Toy Engine", "steam_appid": 5092870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/f619dadc687a4c05943fbc541120d8d4.poster.avif?t=1787435904\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/f619dadc687a4c05943fbc541120d8d4.webm?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/f619dadc687a4c05943fbc541120d8d4.mp4?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fidget Toy Engine brings a collection of interactive toys directly to your desktop. Open a compact transparent window, choose a toy, and keep a satisfying little distraction within reach while you work, study, chat, or take a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/14dc64e71c24019565477ef01734ef32.poster.avif?t=1787435904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/14dc64e71c24019565477ef01734ef32.webm?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/14dc64e71c24019565477ef01734ef32.mp4?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER A VARIETY OF TOYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin a fidget spinner or shuriken, squish slime, tap the keys on a mini keyboard, roll dice, fire a slingshot, send a roulette ball around the wheel, watch a DVD logo bounce, and discover much more. Every toy has its own way to move, react, or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fidget Toy Engine is designed to keep growing, with more toys planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/5a2d4bb714d9ec78918f299e4b8a472c.avif?t=1787435904\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras_big/5a2d4bb714d9ec78918f299e4b8a472c.webp?t=1787435904 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorites or let Random choose for you. Resize the app, adjust volume and brightness, and recolor selected toys with custom colors and metallic finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/318ef070ccd7e2227c853997925b6131.avif?t=1787435904\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras_big/318ef070ccd7e2227c853997925b6131.webp?t=1787435904 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR YOUR DESKTOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the transparent window wherever it works best for you. Keep it above other apps, minimize it to the system tray, or have it launch automatically when your computer starts. Stereo sound subtly shifts with the window's position across your desktop,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMFORTABLE TO USE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a dark or light theme, enlarge interface text, and tune frame rate, anti-aliasing, and shadow quality for your setup. The interface supports ten languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements mark playful milestones, while Steam Cloud keeps supported preferences in sync. There is no fixed way to play—play with a toy for a few seconds or leave one beside you for longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/6c6ceadeb2ef12e010500dc005626908.poster.avif?t=1787435904\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/6c6ceadeb2ef12e010500dc005626908.webm?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/6c6ceadeb2ef12e010500dc005626908.mp4?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/f619dadc687a4c05943fbc541120d8d4.poster.avif?t=1787435904\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/f619dadc687a4c05943fbc541120d8d4.webm?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/f619dadc687a4c05943fbc541120d8d4.mp4?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fidget Toy Engine brings a collection of interactive toys directly to your desktop. Open a compact transparent window, choose a toy, and keep a satisfying little distraction within reach while you work, study, chat, or take a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/14dc64e71c24019565477ef01734ef32.poster.avif?t=1787435904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/14dc64e71c24019565477ef01734ef32.webm?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/14dc64e71c24019565477ef01734ef32.mp4?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER A VARIETY OF TOYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin a fidget spinner or shuriken, squish slime, tap the keys on a mini keyboard, roll dice, fire a slingshot, send a roulette ball around the wheel, watch a DVD logo bounce, and discover much more. Every toy has its own way to move, react, or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fidget Toy Engine is designed to keep growing, with more toys planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/5a2d4bb714d9ec78918f299e4b8a472c.avif?t=1787435904\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras_big/5a2d4bb714d9ec78918f299e4b8a472c.webp?t=1787435904 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorites or let Random choose for you. Resize the app, adjust volume and brightness, and recolor selected toys with custom colors and metallic finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/318ef070ccd7e2227c853997925b6131.avif?t=1787435904\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras_big/318ef070ccd7e2227c853997925b6131.webp?t=1787435904 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR YOUR DESKTOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the transparent window wherever it works best for you. Keep it above other apps, minimize it to the system tray, or have it launch automatically when your computer starts. Stereo sound subtly shifts with the window's position across your desktop,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMFORTABLE TO USE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a dark or light theme, enlarge interface text, and tune frame rate, anti-aliasing, and shadow quality for your setup. The interface supports ten languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements mark playful milestones, while Steam Cloud keeps supported preferences in sync. There is no fixed way to play—play with a toy for a few seconds or leave one beside you for longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/6c6ceadeb2ef12e010500dc005626908.poster.avif?t=1787435904\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/6c6ceadeb2ef12e010500dc005626908.webm?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5092870/extras/6c6ceadeb2ef12e010500dc005626908.mp4?t=1787435904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fidget Toy Engine is a desktop app that lets you enjoy a variety of interactive toys. Spin, click, squish, roll, launch, and customize them while you work, study, or relax. Keep your favorites close in a transparent window with satisfying sounds and colorful styles.", "supported_languages": "English, G